<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>To the work! to the work! let the hungry be fed;</l><l>To the fountain of life let the thirsty be led;</l><l>In the cross and its vict’ry our glory shall be,</l><l>While we herald the tidings, “Salvation is free!”</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>To the work! to the work! in the strength of the Lord,</l><l>By the pow’r of His Name, with the light of His Word,</l><l>All the slaves of the darkness of Satan set free</l><l>And His riches of grace in His glory we’ll see.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
